 "disagreements": [
  "Gemma 4 FLEURS average: card 0.08 (E4B) vs report Table 7 0.075; card 0.09 (E2B) vs report 0.090. Charts use the report's per-language table.",
  "Gemma 4 CoVoST: card 35.54 (E4B) and 33.47 (E2B) vs report Table 7 38.2 and 35.4 (CorpusBLEU, 7 languages).",
  "Gemma 4 Tau2 average: report per-domain values average to 45.8 (E4B) and 28.4 (E2B) vs card 42.2 and 24.5. Not charted.",
  "Gemma 3 27B MMLU-Pro: 67.6 on the Gemma 4 card vs 67.5 on the Gemma 3 card. Chart uses 67.6 (same table as Gemma 4).",
  "Whisper large-v2 FLEURS: the paper's Table 13 and OpenAI's README chart disagree (e.g. Chinese 14.7 vs 7.46, Hindi 21.5 vs 21.75) because they were scored differently. Charts use the paper table only.",
  "Whisper large-v3 FLEURS values are read from OpenAI's README bar chart (no table), accurate to about 0.05; they appear only in tooltips and tables.",
  "AMD Radeon PRO W7900 FP16 vector: 61.3 TFLOPs on the W7900 page vs 123 on the W7900 Dual Slot page. We quote only FP16 matrix (123), which both agree on."
 ],
 "excluded": [
  "WMT24++: Qwen scores a 55-language subset with XCOMET-XXL, Gemma 3/3n use ChrF; Gemma 4 publishes none.",
  "Global-MMLU, MMLU-ProX, FLORES: no Gemma 4 numbers published.",
  "LiveCodeBench, Tau2, OmniDocBench: not relevant to this use, or settings differ (version windows, domain fixes, metric direction).",
  "Ministral 3 and Phi-4 reasoning models: published GPQA Diamond numbers exist but their reasoning setting only loosely matches Gemma's thinking mode, so they are left out.",
  "Llama 3.x / 4: official cards share no benchmark with the Gemma 4 table under the same setting.",
  "Qwen3.5-2B GPQA: reported as \"GPQA\" without the subset."
 ],
